---
// Arknights 风格自定义鼠标：PNG 小光标 + 跟随圆环 + 点击波纹（无防抖，连点每次都出波纹）
---

<div id="cursor-container" aria-hidden="true" transition:persist>
  <div id="cursor-outer"></div>
</div>

<!-- 光标规则内联进每页 HTML：外链 CSS 有加载窗口期，点击跳页后光标会闪回系统箭头，鼠标动一下才恢复 -->
<style is:inline>
  /* 通配 + !important：所有元素任何状态（含脚本 inline 设置的 cursor）一律显示自定义十字，
     盖过 global.css 里的 cursor: pointer / zoom-in / grab 等系统光标，避免来回切换 */
  html,
  html body,
  html body * {
    cursor: url("/images/cursor-inner.png") 3 3, default !important;
  }

  /* 可交互元素保留 pointer 兜底：PNG 万一加载失败仍能提示可点 */
  html body a,
  html body button,
  html body label,
  html body summary,
  html body [role="button"],
  html body .nav-links a,
  html body .button,
  html body .image-lightbox__button {
    cursor: url("/images/cursor-inner.png") 3 3, pointer !important;
  }

  /* 禁止链接/图片原生拖拽：按住拖动时光标会被浏览器接管成系统箭头 */
  html body a,
  html body img {
    -webkit-user-drag: none;
    user-drag: none;
  }
</style>

<style is:global>
  #cursor-container #cursor-outer {
    position: fixed;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 65536;
    height: 36px;
    width: 36px;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    border-radius: 50%;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transform: translate3d(-50%, -50%, 0);
    transition: background-color 0.3s, width 0.3s, height 0.3s;
  }

  #cursor-container .cursor-effect {
    position: fixed;
    z-index: 65535;
    height: 80px;
    width: 80px;
    border: 4px solid #ccc;
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translate3d(-50%, -50%, 0) scale(0);
  }

  /* 触屏设备没有鼠标，隐藏圆环与波纹 */
  @media (hover: none), (pointer: coarse) {
    #cursor-container {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  const container = document.getElementById("cursor-container");
  const outer = document.getElementById("cursor-outer");

  if (container && outer) {
    // ---- 圆环跟随：rAF 插值缓动（系数 0.3，与参考站一致） ----
    let targetX = 0;
    let targetY = 0;
    let shown = false;
    let moving = false;

    const move = () => {
      const left = parseFloat(outer.style.left || "0");
      const top = parseFloat(outer.style.top || "0");
      const dx = 0.3 * (targetX - left);
      const dy = 0.3 * (targetY - top);
      outer.style.left = (left + dx).toFixed(2) + "px";
      outer.style.top = (top + dy).toFixed(2) + "px";
      if (Math.abs(dx) > 0.2 || Math.abs(dy) > 0.2) {
        window.requestAnimationFrame(move);
      } else {
        moving = false;
      }
    };

    window.addEventListener(
      "mousemove",
      (e) => {
        targetX = e.clientX;
        targetY = e.clientY;
        if (!shown) {
          shown = true;
          outer.style.left = `${targetX}px`;
          outer.style.top = `${targetY}px`;
          outer.style.opacity = "1";
          return;
        }
        if (!moving) {
          moving = true;
          window.requestAnimationFrame(move);
        }
      },
      { passive: true }
    );

    // ---- hover 可交互元素时圆环收缩 ----
    const ATTENTION = "a, button, input, textarea, select, label, summary, [role='button']";

    const hold = () => {
      outer.style.height = "24px";
      outer.style.width = "24px";
      outer.style.background = "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5)";
    };

    const relax = () => {
      outer.style.height = "36px";
      outer.style.width = "36px";
      outer.style.background = "unset";
    };

    document.addEventListener("mouseover", (e) => {
      const target = e.target as Element | null;
      if (target && typeof target.closest === "function" && target.closest(ATTENTION)) hold();
    });
    document.addEventListener("mouseout", (e) => {
      const target = e.target as Element | null;
      if (target && typeof target.closest === "function" && target.closest(ATTENTION)) relax();
    });

    // ---- 点击波纹：不做防抖，每次点击都生成独立波纹 ----
    window.addEventListener(
      "click",
      (e) => {
        const effect = document.createElement("div");
        effect.className = "cursor-effect";
        effect.style.left = `${e.clientX}px`;
        effect.style.top = `${e.clientY}px`;
        container.appendChild(effect);

        const animation = effect.animate(
          [
            { transform: "translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0)", opacity: "1" },
            { transform: "translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1)", opacity: "0" },
          ],
          { duration: 500, easing: "cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.21, 1)" }
        );
        animation.onfinish = () => effect.remove();
        // 兜底清理，避免动画被中断时残留节点
        window.setTimeout(() => effect.remove(), 800);
      },
      { passive: true }
    );
  }
</script>
